{"id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#cor:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-bound","title":"cor:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-bound","path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI.md","line":657,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI.tex#cor:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-bound","uses":["[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#def:pet-ch6-convexity-radius]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#thm:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-criterion]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#lem:pet-ch6-klingenberg-injectivity-estimate]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI.tex","label":"cor:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-bound","line":1462,"source":"\\begin{corollary}[convexity-radius lower bound]\n  \\label{cor:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-bound}\n  \\source{petersen:page-0275}\n  \\uses{def:pet-ch6-convexity-radius, thm:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-criterion, lem:pet-ch6-klingenberg-injectivity-estimate}\n\n\n  By \\cref{thm:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-criterion} and\n  \\cref{lem:pet-ch6-klingenberg-injectivity-estimate},\n  $\\operatorname{conv.rad}(M,g)\\ge\\min\\{\\operatorname{inj}(M,g)/2,\\ \\pi/(2\\sqrt K)\\}$ where\n  $K=\\sup\\sec(M,g)$; in nonpositive curvature this simplifies to\n  $\\operatorname{conv.rad}(M,g)=\\operatorname{inj}(M,g)/2$. (Split out from\n  \\cref{def:pet-ch6-convexity-radius} so that definition's Lean does not depend on\n  the still-open \\cref{thm:pet-ch6-convexity-radius-criterion} and\n  \\cref{lem:pet-ch6-klingenberg-injectivity-estimate}.)\n\\end{corollary}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Corollary</d